Ladybird resolves “color: initial” against the element’s used color
scheme. Blink does the same: Color::ApplyInitial() sets the color from
ComputedStyleBuilder::InitialColorForColorScheme(). So does WebKit,
whose BuilderCustom::applyInitialColor() resolves canvastext against
the element’s style. Gecko’s color longhand has a fixed initial value,
AbsoluteColor::BLACK, which doesn’t follow the color scheme.
